{#
  The renter as the first line of a booking in a list: their name in bold, then
  the organisation they act for, when they gave one (#708, IT-06). Both are
  already on the booking — no query, no extra decryption. Long values wrap;
  nothing is truncated.

  Shared by « À traiter » (`_attention_row.html.twig`) and « En cours en ce
  moment » on the asset's overview, so the two lists name people the same way.

  Requires `booking` (Booking\RentalBooking).
#}
<span class="fw-semibold">{{ booking.renterName }}</span>{% if booking.renterOrganisation %} <span class="text-body-secondary">— {{ booking.renterOrganisation }}</span>{% endif %}
